{
  "name": "item-blocks",
  "normalizations": [
    "Compare the packets sent about items meeting blocks: slowed on soul sand and honey, stuck in a cobweb and powder snow, sliding down the side of honey, burnt in fire and soul fire beside a fire-resistant netherite ingot, and a burning item melting powder snow.",
    "Each moving item stops against a stone wall, so where it rests does not depend on its entity ID.",
    "The weather is cleared, and fire burns on netherrack, so it never goes out at random; the fire blocks are not compared.",
    "Entity IDs and UUIDs are left out; motion is compared as sent.",
    "Use matching flat terrain."
  ],
